<SimplePage
  title="Touch-Free Service Options"
  description="Gene Johnson offers touch-free service options including contactless payment, virtual consultations, and PPE-equipped technicians."
  path="/touch-free-service/"
  eyebrow="Service Options"
  tagline="Comfortable service on your terms."
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: "Home", href: "/" }, { name: "Touch-Free Service" }]}
>
  <p>
    For customers who prefer minimal in-person contact, we offer a touch-free service path from booking through payment.
  </p>

  <h2>What touch-free service includes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Phone or video consultation before dispatching a technician when possible</li>
    <li>Shoe covers and protective equipment worn in your home on request</li>
    <li>Contactless payment options - no need to handle cash or cards in person</li>
    <li>Digital invoices and estimates sent by email or text</li>
  </ul>

  <p>
    Just mention you'd like touch-free service when you <a href="/schedule-now/">book online</a> or call, and we'll accommodate your preference.
  </p>
</SimplePage>
